Each team has {{ team_size }} viewers, each holding a private board of objects (a shape and a color in a cell of a {{ grid_size }}x{{ grid_size }} grid). Exactly one object is on every board of a team, and other objects are on some boards but not all, so the viewers {% if canvas %}send each other drawings on a {{ canvas_width }}x{{ canvas_height }} canvas, received as images, {% else %}talk {% endif %}{% if one_to_one %}one teammate at a time on direct channels{% else %}on a shared link channel{% endif %} to find the one they all hold, and every member must submit it.{% if two_teams %} Two teams compete on the same boards each round: among teams whose every member submits the correct object, {% if team_characters == "busiest_member" %}the one whose busiest member sent the fewest {{ unit }} wins.{% else %}the one that sent the fewest {{ unit }} wins.{% endif %}{% if simulated_opponent_ratio is not none %} Team B is simulated: only Team A plays, and Team B is reported as getting every round right in {% if simulated_opponent_ratio is number %}{{ simulated_opponent_ratio }} times Team A's {{ unit }}{% else %}a share of Team A's {{ unit }} drawn each round between {{ simulated_opponent_ratio[0] }} and {{ simulated_opponent_ratio[1] }}{% endif %}, rounded down. Team A is told nothing that a real Team B would not produce.{% endif %}{% elif team_characters == "busiest_member" %} The {{ unit }} sent by the busiest member are the score to minimize.{% else %} The {{ unit }} sent are the score to minimize.{% endif %} The run lasts {{ round_count }} rounds.{% if postmortem_mode == "chosen_partner" %} In each discussion phase, a viewer can message only the first teammate it messages in that phase.{% elif postmortem_mode == "single_author" %} Only Viewer 1 of each team posts in the discussion phases.{% elif postmortem_mode == "rotating_author" %} One viewer of each team posts in each discussion phase, in seat order: Viewer 1 after round 1, Viewer 2 after round 2, and so on.{% endif %}{% if postmortem_character_limit > 0 %} Each viewer may send at most {{ postmortem_character_limit }} characters in each discussion phase.{% endif %}
